{"ID":"20240629145257-wfvicig","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"icon":"2b50","id":"20240629145257-wfvicig","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240629145257-wfvicig\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240629145257-xs1j5xs\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240629145257-xs1j5xs\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"使用教程","type":"doc","updated":"20240914012008"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240913095855-1jq60ch","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913095855-1jq60ch","updated":"20240913101659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8); font-size: 24px;"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"该笔记仅适用于有中医基础经验之人！如有疾患请及时就医，因笔记使用造成不当后果的本人概不负责！！"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8); font-size: 24px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240913100611-6mesl53","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913100611-6mesl53","updated":"20240913101702"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8); font-size: 24px;"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"该笔记仅适用于有中医基础经验之人！如有疾患请及时就医，因笔记使用造成不当后果的本人概不负责！！"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8); font-size: 24px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240913100612-w7v1vc6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913100612-w7v1vc6","updated":"20240913101704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8); font-size: 24px;"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"该笔记仅适用于有中医基础经验之人！如有疾患请及时就医，因笔记使用造成不当后果的本人概不负责！！"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8); font-size: 24px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240913100620-qadh9ef","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913100620-qadh9ef","updated":"20240913100620"}},{"ID":"20240629145257-xs1j5xs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240629145257-xs1j5xs","updated":"20240913103749"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"本笔记最大的作用是‘搜索’，与其说是笔记，称之为数据库更为恰当，虽品类不多，但其数据量已达到网站级别。"}]},{"ID":"20240913132815-pm14r3i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913132815-pm14r3i","updated":"20240913133246"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"目录命名规则："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240913132840-id40hg2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913132840-id40hg2","updated":"20240913141817"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"素材："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"主要收录在用资料；"}]},{"ID":"20240913132901-4xb7m6l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913132901-4xb7m6l","updated":"20240913133249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"视频同步文字："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"即视频转录文字，进行二次校对，使语感更便于阅读；"}]},{"ID":"20240913132952-68e96lt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913132952-68e96lt","updated":"20240913133250"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"笔记："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"顾名思义；"}]},{"ID":"20240913132815-el0y7p2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913132815-el0y7p2","updated":"20240913133251"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"方便法门："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"取自JT叔叔的说法，方便法门，精在个人，主要收录一些常见病症的对治手段，归根结底为方便法门，用药配伍仍需辨证论治。"}]},{"ID":"20240913133141-2k6sdl7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913133141-2k6sdl7","updated":"20240913133252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"药势："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"即对中药药性进行的讲解；"}]},{"ID":"20240913132815-n5vq0ag","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913132815-n5vq0ag","updated":"20240913132815"}},{"ID":"20240913103549-qi4naqg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913103549-qi4naqg","updated":"20240913103549"}},{"ID":"20240913101743-97b2hsd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913101743-97b2hsd","updated":"20240913102658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"网络上虽流传许多制造好的文档，但在实际使用中作用不大，举例如下："}]},{"ID":"20240913102456-hnomrwa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913102456-hnomrwa","updated":"20240913103757"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"当你需要查找倪海厦对某某药性的见解时，一般你有两个选择。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240913102706-szhg3he","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913102706-szhg3he","updated":"20240913103808"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（1）"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"于各大视频网站搜索查看相关的视频"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（这也是许多人常用的方法，当然你也观看本地已下载的视频，但无法索引，拖动进度条寻找效率极低）；倘若哪天因不可抗力因素，全网视频下架封杀，即无法使用，且观看视频效率是不如文字的。"}]},{"ID":"20240913102710-518186w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913102710-518186w","updated":"20240913103814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（2）"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"查看文字稿"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，你需要做的步骤有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"→于手机或电脑中找到对应的文档（如‘神农本草视频同步文字上册B5.pdf’）→搜索中药名称（如‘甘草’）。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240913103104-msvob0i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913103104-msvob0i","updated":"20240913104536"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"整个过程看似两步，实际上操作步骤不仅如此，比如你需要从众多的文档当中找到‘"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"神农本草视频同步文字上册B5.pdf"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"’，如果本身收录文档较多的话，你可能还需要在搜索‘甘草’以前再进行一步对该文档的搜索，搜索结果没有目录的话还得一直‘查找下一个’进行定位，另外由于有的文字稿分上下两册，在不知道所查中药在哪一册的前提下，你有可能得查阅两遍，有的时候pdf文件里面收录的还是图片，并非文字，并不能索引。"}]},{"ID":"20240913103934-p1ad8x5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913103934-p1ad8x5","updated":"20240913104230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"该方法多有不足，所以很多时候这些文档被制作者辛苦制作出来，多为鸡肋，沦为收藏品的存在。"}]},{"ID":"20240913103203-cx9rykv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913103203-cx9rykv","updated":"20240913111907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"而通过本数据库搜索，你只需要如下步骤。（因笔记内容大多数以文字形式收录，即便是图鉴各本草也是独立收录，故在搜索时能很快的搜索到想要的东西。）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240913101345-iuzfv2t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913101345-iuzfv2t","updated":"20240913105230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（1）打开思源笔记app，展开倪海厦-神农本草经-药势"}]},{"ID":"20240913104651-rwk0pgl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913104651-rwk0pgl","updated":"20240913112403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（2）右键‘药势’搜索-第一个结果即为所需结果，双击即可进入；（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"注：思源笔记支持PC、安卓、IOS，移动端操作步骤大致相同"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"）"}]},{"ID":"20240913105137-siysjd6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913105137-siysjd6","updated":"20240913105137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 1111px;","style":"width: 1101px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240913105137-xhkc1lj.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 1101px;\" parent-style=\"width: 1111px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240913105035-retoiws","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913105035-retoiws","updated":"20240913105145"}},{"ID":"20240913105317-wr3u4oy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913105317-wr3u4oy","updated":"20240913105317"}},{"ID":"20240913105239-athkof9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913105239-athkof9","updated":"20240913112134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px;"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"以上仅举例，用于示意笔记的方便之处。下面的使用场景不再进行详细说明，一笔带过，或有朦胧不详尽之处，读者可自行摸索再进一步推扩使用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240913105407-gdv6b6l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913105407-gdv6b6l","updated":"20240913111106"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"1、需要查看某医生对某方剂的见解，如桂枝汤。（目前第2版仅收录谭杰中、倪海厦，后续如版本更新步骤相差不大）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240913104619-hdhp9qy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913104619-hdhp9qy","updated":"20240913131854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"展开 谭杰中-伤寒杂病论（慢慢教）-方剂 ，右键搜索桂枝汤，第一个结果"}]},{"ID":"20240913110159-1f6c7f8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913110159-1f6c7f8","updated":"20240913111126"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"展开 倪海厦-伤寒论-方剂 ，右键搜索桂枝汤，第一个结果"}]},{"ID":"20240913104620-bv6jr70","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913104620-bv6jr70","updated":"20240913104620"}},{"ID":"20240913132103-w31894x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913132103-w31894x","updated":"20240913132227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、治疗某种病症，用药方剂上需要参考，如‘手指冰冷’。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240913132103-g1w3ady","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913132103-g1w3ady","updated":"20240914012008"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"展开 谭杰中-伤寒杂病论（慢慢教）-方便法门，右键搜索‘"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"手指冰冷"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"’，搜索结果是‘"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"当归四逆汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"’；"}]},{"ID":"20240913132247-9brorzx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913132247-9brorzx","updated":"20240913141439"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"再而到"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"谭杰中-伤寒杂病论（慢慢教）-方剂，右键搜索‘"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"当归四逆汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"’，可以查找到当归四逆汤介绍相关；"}]},{"ID":"20240913132103-ng2u252","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913132103-ng2u252","updated":"20240913132103"}},{"ID":"20240913104620-96gjsai","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913104620-96gjsai","updated":"20240913134431"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3、日常应用或谈论或其他原因需要回忆起某部分朦胧的内容时，如谭杰中提到‘阳实则顺生’、如倪海厦金匮中讲到的胃的蠕动方式，忘记后续部分了，需要搜索出来。（视频或书种）（如记忆模糊可逐渐缩减搜索的相关的关键字数量）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"（像谭杰中、倪海厦这类有视频讲课相关的，其同目录下的所有内容都取自‘视频同步文字’，所以只要关键词没错，一般都能搜索到结果）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240913110316-7ooohhl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913110316-7ooohhl","updated":"20240913141437"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"展开 谭杰中-伤寒杂病论（慢慢教）-视频同步文字，右键搜索‘"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"阳实则顺生"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"’，然后在查找出来的结果中，定位正确的段落。"}]},{"ID":"20240913111326-ty17jv4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913111326-ty17jv4","updated":"20240913141435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"展开 倪海厦-金匮要略-视频同步文字，右键搜索‘"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"蠕动方式"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"’，然后在查找出来的结果中，定位正确的段落。。"}]},{"ID":"20240913112500-lciio1y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913112500-lciio1y","updated":"20240913112500"}},{"ID":"20240913111326-1jhmnjc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913111326-1jhmnjc","updated":"20240913132111"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"4、路边看到一株草药，不确定是否就是常用的‘黄芪’。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240913110316-dobr4mi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913110316-dobr4mi","updated":"20240913141433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"右键中草药图鉴，搜索‘"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄芪"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"’，对比植物形态是否一致；"}]},{"ID":"20240913101345-1wry7wp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913101345-1wry7wp","updated":"20240913101345"}},{"ID":"20240913111837-zwdnebn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913111837-zwdnebn","updated":"20240913141422"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"5、忘记某药药性，或想看某药诸多注解上对比，或给学生上课展示植物的植株模样——如半夏。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240913112152-wkkz6cr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913112152-wkkz6cr","updated":"20240913141431"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"右键中草药图鉴，搜索‘"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"半夏"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"’；"}]},{"ID":"20240913132756-x3gtiov","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913132756-x3gtiov","updated":"20240913132756"}},{"ID":"20240913132356-5tdy9f8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913132356-5tdy9f8","updated":"20240913135228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"6、有时候搜索结果不尽人意，还有一种较为极限，但相对麻烦的定位方式，就是不进子目录，直接在‘人名’下搜索。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"（除非关键词较长且正确，否则不建议用该方法）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240913132612-nx2nvls","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913132612-nx2nvls","updated":"20240913141515"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"如 倪海厦-右键搜索‘"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"肝癌肝硬化病例"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"’；（如搜索结果有很多，需要逐个翻阅定位正确的段落）"}]},{"ID":"20240913135155-bk57343","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913135155-bk57343","updated":"20240913135155"}},{"ID":"20240913101339-jb5pd5u","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240913101339-jb5pd5u"}},{"ID":"20240913095656-7phtt96","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913095656-7phtt96","updated":"20240913095656"}},{"ID":"20240913095847-zszkgh7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913095847-zszkgh7","updated":"20240913095847"}},{"ID":"20240913095847-yvu4u82","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913095847-yvu4u82","updated":"20240913095847"}},{"ID":"20240913095848-78nasoa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913095848-78nasoa","updated":"20240913095848"}},{"ID":"20240913095848-2ql101o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913095848-2ql101o","updated":"20240913095848"}},{"ID":"20240913095848-pacyrxn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913095848-pacyrxn","updated":"20240913095848"}},{"ID":"20240913095851-kmemx5o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913095851-kmemx5o","update